g the night under the stars, the right camp shelter makes all the difference. Tents are essential camp shelters, offering a safe, dry, and comfortable place to rest after a day of hiking, fishing, or just enjoying nature. Whether you're heading out on a weekend getaway or planning an extended family vacation, we’re here to help you find the right tent for you and your crew. When it comes to convenience and ease of use, instant tents are the best of the best in camp shelters. Our innovative instant hub technology and pre-attached poles redefine camping with a setup so fast that your tent is ready in under two minutes. Whether you're a first-time camper, setting up in the dark, or just want more time to enjoy the outdoors and less time fiddling with poles, an instant tent is a total game-changer. They’re especially ideal for car camping, festivals, and weekend getaways where every minute counts. But that doesn’t mean traditional setup tents don’t have their perks. In fact, traditional tents still shine when pack size and weight are a priority. If you're backpacking, hiking into a remote site, or need to fit all your gear into a small car, a traditional tent may be a better fit for you.","address":null,"distance_km":null,"lat":null,"lon":null,"certifications":[],"signals":[],"score":0.625,"components":[{"name":"relevance","value":1,"weight":0.25,"contribution":0.25,"sources":[{"label":"Camping Tents for Families | Instant Setup | CORE Equipment – Core Equipment","url":"https://www.coreequipment.com/collections/tents"}]},{"name":"ethics","value":0.5,"weight":0.3,"contribution":0.15,"sources":[{"label":"Baseline 0.5","url":"https://bfaloona.github.io/nottheriver/about.html#ranking"}],"minor_cap_applied":false},{"name":"env","value":0.5,"weight":0.3,"contribution":0.15,"sources":[{"label":"Baseline 0.5","url":"https://bfaloona.github.io/nottheriver/about.html#ranking"}],"minor_cap_applied":false},{"name":"proximity","value":0.5,"weight":0.15,"contribution":0.075,"sources"